controls.row1:
**Row 1 — Playback**

**🔀 Shuffle**
-# Randomize the queue order · or {{cmdShuffle}}

**⏮️ Previous**
-# Go back to the last played track · or {{cmdPrevious}}

**⏸️ Pause / Play**
-# Toggle playback · or {{cmdPause}}

**⏭️ Skip**
-# Skip to the next track · or {{cmdSkip}}

**🔁 Loop**
-# Cycle: Off → Track → Queue · or {{cmdLoop}}

controls.row2:
**Row 2 — Extras**

**📻 Autoplay**
-# Auto-queue similar songs when queue ends · or {{cmdAutoplay}}

**🔉 Vol↓  ·  🔊 Vol↑**
-# Adjust volume by ±10% · or {{cmdVolume}}

**⏹️ Stop**
-# Stop playback and disconnect · or {{cmdStop}}

**📜 Queue**
-# Open the queue viewer · or {{cmdQueue}}

